# Sanitized patch for design note 18: a fallback switch between two interfaces (the service).
# Generalises the existing interface-switch command into one helper with a queue selector and
# adds the new command (-I/--interface grpc|bridge|all, coverage check, --force). Unified diff,
# 3 lines of context, 2 files, +177/-4.
# Identifiers are illustrative and do not come from any public tree; the patch is for reading
# alongside the note. Verification: both files compile (py_compile); applies cleanly to a
# private checkout (git apply --check). No unit tests exist for the command being generalised;
# not run against a database.

